    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_612_01:612_01_012:e06dc9c7",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C06_612_01",
        "key": "612_01_012",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_612_01:612_01_012:e06dc9c7",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_612_01:612_01_012:e06dc9c7",
        "jp_sha256": "d420ed7f8dbed34e2bc6d752dace9507cffe570a481d1376d9ff390c304fb5df",
        "official_en_sha256": "7415be7b79aa2312a2fda0e5bbdd8949f4bb57495acc739faaea622254da64c9"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だとしても、\r\nそれを追い求めて何が悪い！",
        "official_en": "A mirage it may be—but I see no cause to forgo our reckoning!",
        "real_en": "Even if it is, what's wrong with chasing it!?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
